    "scope": "ONLY for true synonyms / alternate snake_case spellings. Do NOT use this map to merge legitimately distinct canonical labels (e.g. POCSO vs POSH vs BNS variants of harassment); those should remain separate so multi-statute FIRs can carry one event per applicable statute.",
